/* 5. Reduced-motion contract — kill every additive animation, pin static
   states, hide particles entirely. Existing component behavior remains
   fully functional (clicks still register, phases still advance, ARIA
   live regions still announce). */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .checkin-polish .checkin-particle-layer,
